logic:cqLicensedFalsehoodSafeHolds
    a logic:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic> ;
    rdfs:label "licensed falsehood is not deception holds"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The positive competency case the licensed-falsehood safety partition must satisfy: a gmeow:Event whose gmeow:projectedStandpoint carries gmeow:claimVeridicality gmeow:veridicalityLicensedFalsehood (fiction, satire, sarcasm) is NOT a gmeow:eventTypeDeception, even though it carries a held/projected gap. The well-formed case the exclusion admits."@x-gmeow-english .
logic:cqLicensedFalsehoodDeceptionRejected
    a logic:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/logic> ;
    rdfs:label "licensed falsehood classified as deception is rejected"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The negative countermodel the licensed-falsehood safety partition must respect: classifying a socially-licensed non-truth-asserting projection (a novel, a satire) as deception is rejected — the audience understands the non-asserting frame. HONEST SCOPE: the exclusion is realized in the OWL / full-FOL projection (strong negation in the head); the native monotone chase does not enforce it, disclosed in the loss ledger."@x-gmeow-english .
logic:candidateLicensedFalsehoodNotDeception
    a logic:NamedIndividual ,
