    skos:definition "The equivalence-definition formalization candidate governing logic:bullshitTruthIndifference: to carry gmeow:claimModality gmeow:bullshit is exactly to be a gmeow:StandpointClaim held with gmeow:claimTruthDirectedness gmeow:truthIndifferent — Frankfurt's bullshit, neither true nor false under the standpoint. truthIndifferent uniquely selects the bullshit modality among the five, so it is definitional. Realized in the OWL / full-FOL projection (biconditional), non-monotone, disclosed in the loss ledger — NOT natively enforced. Harvested from gmeow:bullshit's skos:definition. Accepted through review with a positive case (logic:cqBullshitIndifferenceHolds) and a negative countermodel (logic:cqBullshitIndifferenceLieRejected)."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:candidateSourceHash "sha256:c0c4ef42d3dded8c978b2667694654d06b5d470dc1c93fb882b801b296ddf50d"^^xsd:string ;
